Package: hookdeployed
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: HookDeploy <support@hookdeploy.dev>
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Depends: adduser, debconf (>= 0.5)
Recommends: ca-certificates
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/hookdeploy/hookdeployed
Description: HookDeploy mTLS webhook delivery agent
 Single-binary client that dials out to HookDeploy's relay network over
 mutual TLS and delivers webhooks to localhost. No inbound ports.
 .
 Default apt install places the binary and systemd unit but does not
 start the service. Enroll in a terminal, or preseed
 hookdeployed/enroll_token for unattended enroll and start.
